sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Pasajero app
    participant API as UserController API
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant D as Conductor app
    participant FCM as Firebase FCM

    P->>API: POST ride-booking
    API->>DB: crear user_ride_booking
    API->>FCM: notificar conductores cercanos

    D->>API: POST available-ride-request
    D->>API: POST driver-bid
    P->>API: POST accept-ride / decline-request

    D->>API: POST update-ride-status
    P->>API: POST ride-payment
    API->>DB: wallet / Wompi según método
    P->>API: POST ride-user-rating
